{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55631","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十九 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽栖岂可事徒然，昼讽《莲经》夜坐禅。\n吟里有声皆实相，定中无境不虚玄。\n直教似月临千界，还遣如空度万缘。\n从此必知宏此志，免教虚掷愧前贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}